      "COBOL: FALFLAGA-FLAG-BYTE-A",
      "Bit 0: LH_FND_TRS_ALC_SET.ALC_SRC_CD",
      "Bit 1: LH_FND_TRS_ALC_SET.AUTOCLOS_PROC_IND",
      "Bit 2: LH_FND_TRS_ALC_SET.MTHLVRSY_PROC_IND",
      "Bits 3-6 reserved; bit 7 group-control generation has no verified DB2 source.",
